· cross-examine the port of entry interpreter and immigration officer;
· notice and correct errors of the interpreter;
· adduce evidence regarding the conversion of the Persian calendar to the Gregorian calendar;
· obtain a medical report to confirm that the scars on his body were consistent with his having been tortured; and
